<h1>Reset your password</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.email %>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset the password for your account. Use the token below to set a new password:</p>

<p>
  <strong>Token:</strong> <code><%= @raw_token %></code>
</p>

<p>PATCH to <code>/api/v1/auth/password/reset/confirm</code> with <code>{ "token": "&lt;token&gt;", "password": "&lt;new_password&gt;" }</code></p>

<p>This token expires in 1 hour. If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
